: break-word;'>nineteenth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>23rd</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>twenty-third</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>4th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>fourth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>12th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>twelfth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>20th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>twentieth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>35th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>thirty-fifth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>5th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>fifth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>13th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>thirteenth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>30th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>thirtieth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>101st</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>one hundred</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>6th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>sixth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>14th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>fourteenth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>80th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>eightieth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>and first</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>7th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>seventh</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>15th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>fifteenth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>90th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>ninetieth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>8th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>eighth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>16th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>sixteenth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>100th</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>one hundredth</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr></table>\n\n### 4. 数词的用法：\n\n1) 表示年份: 2002: twenty thousand and two; 1976: nineteen seventy-six.\n\n2) 表示日期：12月1日：Dec. 1st 或 the first of December；2002年11月8日：Nov. 8th, 2002.\n\n3) 表示时刻： $ 5:15 \\rightarrow \\text{five fifteen 或 a quarter past five} $;\n\n $ 8:30 \\rightarrow \\text{eight thirty 或 half past eight} $;\n\n $ 10:45 \\rightarrow \\text{ten forty-five 或 a quarter to eleven} $.\n\n4) 表示编号: Room 105 → Room one 0 five; Bus No. 13 → Bus Number Thirteen;\n\nP.5 → Page Five; Tel. No. 7658659 → Telephone Number seven-six-five-eight-six-five-nine.\n\n5) 小数的读法: 5.7 → five point seven; 0.16 → zero point one six.\n\n6) “半”的表达: 1/2 → half; 半小时 → half an hour; 1.5小时 → one and a half hours 或 one hour and a half.\n\n7) 序数词前面加 the 时，表示顺序，加 a/an 时表示“再一、又一”。如：The third lesson is rather difficult. (第三课相当难) / Shall we read the text a third time? (我们把课文读第三遍，好吗？)",
